From e2e82a7df593a871b197180f5a6db355b16040da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agent <344224964+logan-shire-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:08:14 -0500
Subject: [wasm] build-script: --build-wasi-threads-stdlib-only

With --build-wasi-stdlib, builds the WASI sysroot and the
wasm32-wasip1-threads stdlib alone: WASIStdlib (the wasm32-wasip1 stdlib)
and WASISwiftSDK (the Swift SDK product, which builds corelibs Foundation,
XCTest and swift-testing and needs their checkouts) are skipped.
WASISysroot still builds both triples' sysroots.

For a build that only needs the threads triple's runtime beside an
existing wasm32-wasip1 SDK (Isomer's threads SDK takes swift.org's
wasm32-wasip1 bundle as it is).
---
 utils/build_swift/build_swift/driver_arguments.py     |  6 ++++++
 utils/build_swift/tests/expected_options.py           |  3 +++
 .../swift_build_support/products/wasistdlib.py        | 11 +++++++++--
 .../swift_build_support/products/wasiswiftsdk.py      |  3 ++-
 4 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/utils/build_swift/build_swift/driver_arguments.py b/utils/build_swift/build_swift/driver_arguments.py
index 51d1d6a..cca6a89 100644
--- a/utils/build_swift/build_swift/driver_arguments.py
+++ b/utils/build_swift/build_swift/driver_arguments.py
@@ -859,6 +859,12 @@ def create_argument_parser():
     option(['--build-wasi-stdlib'], toggle_true('build_wasistdlib'),
            help='build the stdlib for WASI target into a'
                 'separate build directory ')
+    option(['--build-wasi-threads-stdlib-only'],
+           toggle_true('build_wasi_threads_stdlib_only'),
+           help='with --build-wasi-stdlib, build the WASI sysroot and the '
+                'wasm32-wasip1-threads stdlib alone: not the wasm32-wasip1 '
+                'stdlib nor the Swift SDK (corelibs Foundation, XCTest, '
+                'swift-testing)')
     option(['--wasmkit'], toggle_true('build_wasmkit'),
            help='build WasmKit')
     option(['--install-wasmkit'], toggle_true('install_wasmkit'),
